# Telemetry ingest (#95). Interim: requires a JWT with role Admin or Operator (devices get API keys in #96).
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile). After pulling, recreate the local DB: docker compose down -v
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@installationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Send a batch (idempotent by deviceId + timestamp; resending returns duplicates)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "installationId": "{{installationId}}",
  "sentAt": "2026-06-21T10:36:00Z",
  "source": "simulator",
  "readings": [
    {
      "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-21T10:35:00Z",
      "intervalSec": 300,
      "status": "MPPT",
      "acPowerW": 7420.5,
      "dcPowerW": 7615.0,
      "acVoltageV": 231.4,
      "acCurrentA": 10.7,
      "gridFrequencyHz": 50.01,
      "temperatureC": 46.2,
      "totalEnergyWh": 18452310.0,
      "dayEnergyWh": 31250.0,
      "strings": [
        { "index": 1, "voltageV": 612.3, "currentA": 6.31, "powerW": 3863.5 },
        { "index": 2, "voltageV": 608.9, "currentA": 6.17, "powerW": 3756.9 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Invalid reading: misaligned timestamp -> 400 with key readings[0].timestamp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "installationId": "{{installationId}}",
  "sentAt": "2026-06-21T10:36:00Z",
  "source": "gateway",
  "readings": [
    { "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}", "timestamp": "2026-06-21T10:33:00Z", "intervalSec": 300, "status": "MPPT", "acPowerW": 1, "totalEnergyWh": 1 }
  ]
}
